From a2bf47aa2f0fd09e34c41ddae4c665507a6a6eb2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charles Ci-Jyun Wu <dminus@andestech.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Aug 2023 14:32:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 129/191] cpufreq: andes-cpufreq: Andes processors PowerBrake
 driver support

---
 drivers/cpufreq/Kconfig         |   4 +
 drivers/cpufreq/Kconfig.riscv   |  11 ++
 drivers/cpufreq/Makefile        |   4 +
 drivers/cpufreq/andes-cpufreq.c | 187 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/soc/andes/andes_sbi.c   |  18 +++
 include/soc/andes/sbi.h         |   4 +
 6 files changed, 228 insertions(+)
